      "locator": "2KI 23:33",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Pharaoh Necoh put him in bonds at Riblah in the land of Hamath, that he might not reign in Jerusalem; and put the land to a tribute of one hundred talents of silver and a talent of gold.",
      "textSHA256": "8ee702009974a35b2b4fd1fa9d0ba4cb8d375fcc1091915ed934b26b205a9676"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-25-6",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI25.htm#V6",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 25:6",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Then they captured the king and carried him up to the king of Babylon to Riblah; and they passed judgment on him.",
      "textSHA256": "5d0c98c9cd58364cbc7a98f31e049e9b490a75094d04936a1663b49219b795fa"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-25-20",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI25.htm#V20",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 25:20",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Nebuzaradan the captain of the guard took them, and brought them to the king of Babylon to Riblah.",
      "textSHA256": "82d6a4a90ff2958c8ee7a296db5ac1d11a322ef7ff07a95d006a053e66ffd8dd"
    },
    {
      "sourceID": "webp-2ki-25-21",
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/2KI25.htm#V21",
      "retrievedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T02:40:00Z",
      "locator": "2KI 25:21",
      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "The king of Babylon attacked them and put them to death at Riblah in the land of Hamath. So Judah was carried away captive out of his land.",
      "textSHA256": "75d4be91871f8bebd00305b9180da1b80e46951a5cba9054df64926e22f99daf"
    }
  ],
